    "detailed_description": "Tilescape Defense is a strategic puzzle-like tower defense where decisions matter. Expand your territory by placing tiles with matching edge features to create a unique landscape on each playthrough.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Expand: Keep expanding your land to find new limited resources.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Manage Resources: Maintain a steady food supply to sustain your defenses and expansion.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Defend: Build defensive forts in strategic places and adapt with swappable weaponry.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Custom paths: Plan and build the path enemies must navigate. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn Tilescape Defense tile placement is the center of the gameplay. You're dealt a random hand of tiles to choose from and each selection refreshes the whole hand. If no tiles match your current landscape, expansion comes to a halt, and survival becomes a challenge.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame is intended to be a constant balance between gaining new resources, maintaining food production and building required defenses in order to survive the next wave of enemies. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nVictory is not to be expected on first playthrough!",
    "about_the_game": "Tilescape Defense is a strategic puzzle-like tower defense where decisions matter. Expand your territory by placing tiles with matching edge features to create a unique landscape on each playthrough.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Expand: Keep expanding your land to find new limited resources.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Manage Resources: Maintain a steady food supply to sustain your defenses and expansion.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Defend: Build defensive forts in strategic places and adapt with swappable weaponry.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Custom paths: Plan and build the path enemies must navigate. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn Tilescape Defense tile placement is the center of the gameplay. You're dealt a random hand of tiles to choose from and each selection refreshes the whole hand. If no tiles match your current landscape, expansion comes to a halt, and survival becomes a challenge.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame is intended to be a constant balance between gaining new resources, maintaining food production and building required defenses in order to survive the next wave of enemies. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nVictory is not to be expected on first playthrough!",
    "short_description": "Tilescape Defense is a puzzle-like tower defense game with expansion and resource management elements. Expand by placing tiles with matching edges. Manage resources. Modify enemy path. Equip forts with different weapons.",
